    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A heavy leather riding jacket with doubled elbows and shoulders, cut for a rig saddle or a hovercraft rail. Outriders, couriers and anyone who spends more time on the road than off it. Turns a slide on gravel into a story and a knife into a scuff.</p><p>No signature. Smells of fuel and weather.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Armor:</strong> Light</li>\n  <li><strong>Defense:</strong> Guard +4, Evasion +4</li>\n  <li><strong>Requires:</strong> Fitting (trained)</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> IV</li>\n  <li><strong>Cost:</strong> 190 Nonlethal marks</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⟡ Crowned (+3). Keyed to a true name. It will not be sold.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>+3 on each of its defense bonuses</strong> → Guard +4, Evasion +4 (rank-scaled like all armor: Trained half, Proficient full).</li>\n  <li>Grade raises it to <strong>Tier IV</strong> · soulbound — one bearer, no sale.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:END -->",
